d others.#{2}":[33,33],"#John Wooden's 9 Promises for a Life Well-Lived##3. I promise to think only of the best, to work only for the best, and to expect only the best in myself and others.#{3}":[34,35],"#John Wooden's 9 Promises for a Life Well-Lived##3. I promise to think only of the best, to work only for the best, and to expect only the best in myself and others.#{4}":[36,40],"#John Wooden's 9 Promises for a Life Well-Lived##4. I promise to be just as enthusiastic about the success of others as I am about my own.":[41,51],"#John Wooden's 9 Promises for a Life Well-Lived##4. I promise to be just as enthusiastic about the success of others as I am about my own.#{1}":[43,51],"#John Wooden's 9 Promises for a Life Well-Lived##5. I promise to be so strong that nothing can disturb my peace of mind.":[52,62],"#John Wooden's 9 Promises for a Life Well-Lived##5. I promise to be so strong that nothing can disturb my peace of mind.#{1}":[54,62],"#John Wooden's 9 Promises for a Life Well-Lived##6. I promise to forget the mistakes of the past and press on to greater achievements in the future.":[63,70],"#John Wooden's 9 Promises for a Life Well-Lived##6. I promise to forget the mistakes of the past and press on to greater achievements in the future.#{1}":[65,70],"#John Wooden's 9 Promises for a Life Well-Lived##7. I promise to wear a cheerful appearance at all times and give every person I meet a smile.":[71,81],"#John Wooden's 9 Promises for a Life Well-Lived##7. I promise to wear a cheerful appearance at all times and give every person I meet a smile.#{1}":[73,81],"#John Wooden's 9 Promises for a Life Well-Lived##8. I promise to give so much time to improving myself that I have no time to criticize others.":[82,88],"#John Wooden's 9 Promises for a Life Well-Lived##8. I promise to give so much time to improving myself that I have no time to criticize others.#{1}":[84,88],"#John Wooden's 9 Promises for a Life Well-Lived##9. I promise to be too large for worry, too noble for anger, too strong for fear, and too happy to permit trouble to press on me.":[89,102],"#John Wooden's 9 Promises for a Life Well-Lived##9. I promise to be too large for worry, too noble for anger, too strong for fear, and too happy to permit trouble to press on me.#{1}":[91,94],"#John Wooden's 9 Promises for a Life Well-Lived##9. I promise to be too large for worry, too noble for anger, too strong for fear, and too happy to permit trouble to press on me.#{2}":[95,95],"#John Wooden's 9 Promises for a Life Well-Lived##9. I promise to be too large for worry, too noble for anger, too strong for fear, and too happy to permit trouble to press on me.#{3}":[96,96],"#John Wooden's 9 Promises for a Life Well-Lived##9. I promise to be too large for worry, too noble for anger, too strong for fear, and too happy to permit trouble to press on me.#{4}":[97,98],"#John Wooden's 9 Promises for a Life Well-Lived##9. I promise to be too large for worry, too noble for anger, too strong for fear, and too happy to permit trouble to press on me.#{5}":[99,102],"#John Wooden's 9 Promises for a Life Well-Lived#Your Promises to Yourself":[103,118],"#John Wooden's 9 Promises for a Life Well-Lived#Your Promises to Yourself#{1}":[105,118]},"outlinks":[],"metadata":{"date":"2024-08-20","tags":["source/blog"],"author":["Sahil Bloom"],"link":null,"publish":false},"last_embed":{"hash":"k93wfb","at":1760805949392},"key":"01 - Sources/Blog/John Wooden's 9 Promises for a Life Well-Lived.md"},
